{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼後ろからがうっち／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんずだぷぅ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電動のやつで毛玉取りしてたら\n楽しくなっちゃって\n毛玉がないところにまで\nとりとりとりとりしてたら\n穴が空きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どあふ！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆腐は木綿派？絹派？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決められない！\nどっちもすきよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかちゃんが普段してる\nメイクについて教えてください♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本ナチュラルです。\nアイラインは細く、\n目尻はちょっとはねるよ。\nチークはオレンジとピンクが\n混ざったような色を使ってるよ。\n日によってマスカラしたり、\nしなかったりするよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は濃いピンクのアイシャドウを\n下まぶたにちょいっとのせてみたり♪\nなんかうるうるして血色が\nよく見える気がするの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"唇は赤みがある方がすきだから\n色付きリップはかかせませーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、メイクさんにやってもらう\nメイクがいちばんでわす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、観た(観たい)映画は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レ・ミゼラブル観たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛いものは好きですか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キムチいける♪すき！\nカクテキめっちゃすき！\n激しく辛いのは食べれない><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの時とかに\n気を付けていることはなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと一緒に楽しむ。\nというか楽しいよ！\nライブだいすき！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子のポーチとしては\n中身は多い方なの？\nこれが標準？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自メイクするときしか\nあんないっぱい入れないよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので基本は2枚目の写真かな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなに使わないのもあるけど...\nほらっ女子だし！\n入れときたいじゃん??←\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からセンター試験が\n始まりますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張れーっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーちゃん若月とジョジョ立ち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーちゃんさゆにゃんと遠近法"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメイジング"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/18/2025191/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}